# TASK/PRESENT01 navigation run. PRESENT.NAP is started by the #Z autorun
# line; the injector clock starts at the first EL0 program (= PRESENT).
# Ticks = hz_200 after arming. IKBD make codes, break = make | 0x80:
# 4D Right, 4B Left, 39 Space, 47 ClrHome, 2A LShift, 01 Esc.
# Slides of the sample file: 1 title (centred), 2 bullets + TEST.PNG,
# 3 bullets + missing NOPE.PNG, 4 long lines / umlauts / hard break.
600 mark S1_TITLE
700 key 4D
703 key CD
1100 mark S2_PICTURE
1200 key 39
1203 key B9
1600 mark S3_MISSING
1700 down
1703 up
2100 mark S4_WRAP_CLICK
2200 key 4B
2203 key CB
2600 mark S3_LEFT
2700 key 2A
2702 key 47
2705 key C7
2707 key AA
3100 mark S4_SHIFTHOME_LAST
3200 key 47
3203 key C7
3600 mark S1_HOME_FIRST
3700 key 4D
3703 key CD
4100 mark S2_RIGHT
4200 rdown
4203 rup
4600 mark S1_RCLICK_PREV
4700 key 01
4703 key 81
6500 mark END_DESKTOP
